Step 1:  Inspect Chart.yaml
cat my-nginx/Chart.yaml

Step 2: Edit values.yaml
nano my-nginx/values.yaml

Find the relevant configuration and set it to the following.
replicaCount: 2

image:
  repository: nginx
  pullPolicy: IfNotPresent
  tag: "1.28"

service:
  type: ClusterIP
  port: 80

autoscaling:
  enabled: false


STEP 3: VALIDATE THE CHART
helm lint my-nginx
helm template nginx-demo ./my-nginx


At this stage, the helm template command has not installed any resources.
